WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
07:40 — Morning check. She opens the vault home and sees three documents expiring this month — including her son's passport.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
12:15 — Documents. Between customers she pulls up scanned passports and school letters — search finds a file in seconds.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
18:30 — Family vault. Her husband's profile stays separate but shared on the same phone — each person's records stay encrypted.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
21:00 — Ramadan planning. She glances at the Zakat summary from holdings in the sample vault before talking to her accountant.
